  "notes": "First orange label issue. \n\nFirst cat. no. (WS 1835) on spine and rear cover; second cat. no. (WS.1835) on labels; third cat. no. (1835) on front cover. \n\nTrack A1 is listed on cover as \"Stoned Me\", but on label as \"And It Stoned Me\".\nThe cover credits for Van Morrison are for Rhythm Guitar and Tambourine only.\nProduced by Van Morrison for Inherit Productions. A division of Schwaid-Merenstein.\n\n℗ 1970\n\nRunouts are stamped.",
